### 创建 Amazon 报表任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "reportType": "GET_MERCHANT_LISTINGS_ALL_DATA",
  "dataStartTime": "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z",
  "dataEndTime": "2026-08-08T00:00:00Z"
}

### 查询 Amazon 报表任务列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "reportTypes": ["GET_MERCHANT_LISTINGS_ALL_DATA"],
  "processingStatuses": ["DONE"],
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 使用分页令牌查询 Amazon 报表任务列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "nextToken": "{{amazonReportsNextToken}}"
}

### 查询 Amazon 报表任务详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "id": "{{amazonReportId}}"
}

### 取消 Amazon 报表任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "id": "{{amazonReportId}}"
}

### 查询 Amazon 报表文件下载信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/reports/document
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "id": "{{amazonReportDocumentId}}"
}
